<title>UK: LME declares TAPOs April settlement prices.</title>
<headline>LME declares TAPOs April settlement prices.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London Metal Exchange declared the monthly average settlement prices for copper and aluminium traded average price options (TAPOs) for April 1997.</p>
<p>The LME said in a notice the settlement price was $2,391.18 per tonne for grade A copper and $1,561.77 for primary aluminium.</p>
